  "description": "Bring autumn warmth to your creative projects with this Cozy Fall Vibes Sticker Bundle.\nThis collection features hand-drawn boho floral and seasonal elements — perfect for planners, scrapbooks, journals, and DIY crafts.\nWhat’s Included:\n– 21 high-quality autumn sticker designs\n– Boho floral & seasonal elements (pumpkins, leaves, mushrooms, rainbows, sun)\n– AI, EPS, PDF, PNG, SVG, JPEG formats\n– 300 DPI transparent background\nPerfect For:\n– Fall greeting cards & journals\n– Printable stickers & planner decor\n– Autumn invitations and gift tags\n– DIY art projects & digital scrapbooking\nHighlights:\n– Cozy and warm boho color palette\n– Easy to print and cut\n– Suitable for Cricut & Silhouette users\n– Designed for both digital and printable use",
